   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The whitewater river Steyr in a green forest in springtime. The water is still blue from the melting snow in the montains in springtime. Location: next to the small ski resort Hinterstoder in the "Totes Gebirge" and Salzkammergut area in Upper Austria.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
